    "lawCode": "Amd §2, Chap 515 of 2013",
    "lawSection": "Education",
    "memo": "BILL NUMBER:S5939A\n\nTITLE OF BILL:  An act to amend chapter 515 of the laws of 2013, relat-\ning to authorizing the East Ramapo central school district to receive\ncertain apportionments on an accelerated basis, in relation to the\n2013-2014 school year\n\nPURPOSE:  To clarify that the temporary advisory committee established\npursuant chapter 515 of the laws of 2013 shall remain in effect for only\nthe 2013-14 school year.\n\nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:  Provides that, for the 2013-14 school year,\nbefore the expenditure of funds received pursuant to the lottery spin-\nup, the superintendent of the East Ramapo central school district shall\nappoint a temporary district based advisory team in the 2013-14 school\nyear to develop a comprehensive expenditure plan of such funds in this\nfirst year.\n\nJUSTIFICATION:  This bill would clarify that the temporary advisory\ncommittee will develop a comprehensive expenditure plan only in the\n2013-14 school year.\n\nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY: New bill.\n\nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS: None.\n\nEFFECTIVE DATE:  This act shall take effect immediately.\n\n",
